sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Agent
    participant UtilityBar as Utility Bar / Parent LWC
    participant Storage as Session Storage
    participant GCP as GCP Backend / WebSocket

    Agent->>UtilityBar: Click Agent Assist (Manual Open)
    Note over UtilityBar: Check: User has PS & No Active Voice Call
    UtilityBar->>UtilityBar: Generate local GUID (interaction_id)
    UtilityBar->>GCP: Publish setInteractionContext (non-telephonic schema)
    GCP-->>UtilityBar: set_interaction_context_notification (ACK with interaction_id & agent_assist_session_id)
    UtilityBar->>Storage: Set isNonTelephonic = true & store session IDs
    UtilityBar-->>Agent: Render AMA / Generic Experience

    opt Customer Search & Selection
        Agent->>UtilityBar: Select Account or Lead on Customer Search Page
        UtilityBar->>GCP: Send setCustomerContext (with interaction_id)
        UtilityBar-->>Agent: Update AA context for selected customer
    end

    opt Incoming / Outgoing Voice Call
        GCP-->>UtilityBar: Voice Call Initiated
        UtilityBar->>GCP: Send endInteraction (close non-telephonic session)
        UtilityBar->>Storage: Clear non-telephonic session storage
        UtilityBar->>GCP: Send setInteractionContext (Voice Call Schema)
        UtilityBar->>Storage: Set isNonTelephonic = false
    end

    opt User Closes Utility Panel
        Agent->>UtilityBar: Close AA Window
        UtilityBar->>GCP: Send endInteraction (with interaction_id)
        UtilityBar->>Storage: Clear all Session Storage & clear cards
    end
